{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25a0Create Spells and Battle in an AI \u00d7 Kanji Duel</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game challenges you to create original four-kanji spells using randomly distributed kanji characters.<br>The AI will analyze and describe the damage, element, and effect of your spell.<br>The thrill lies in how creatively you can combine the given kanji to craft a spell that feels powerful\u2014your word sense is the key to victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25a0Sometimes, Weakness is Strength</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this game, you won\u2019t always win by making the strongest-looking spell.<br>There are moments when crafting a deliberately weak spell is part of the strategy.<br>Your tactical flexibility will be tested.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25a0Chuunibyou-Style Spell Descriptions, Too...?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yes, the AI might even describe your spell in dramatic, over-the-top style\u2014straight out of a teenage fantasy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25a0 Notes</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game uses the conversational AI &quot;ChatGPT&quot; provided by OpenAI. Depending on server load, the game may take extra time to process spell evaluations.<br><br>If OpenAI makes any changes to the ChatGPT service, this game may be suspended or discontinued without prior notice. We appreciate your understanding.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"\u30c8\u30ed\u30d5\u30a3\u30fc \u708e","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3622760/1ad4dc44c525b28fb4bc7bd6c656b1eca2bccf79.jpg"},{"name":"\u30c8\u30ed\u30d5\u30a3\u30fc \u96f7","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3622760/b77bf0216a8a9ae59e004b38435c989bfe78ceb3.jpg"},{"name":"\u30c8\u30ed\u30d5\u30a3\u30fc \u70c8","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3622760/ac43604345f208b9450d4729