 Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25a0Create Spells and Battle in an AI \u00d7 Kanji Duel</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game challenges you to create original four-kanji spells using randomly distributed kanji characters.<br>The AI will analyze and describe the damage, element, and effect of your spell.<br>The thrill lies in how creatively you can combine the given kanji to craft a spell that feels powerful\u2014your word sense is the key to victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25a0Sometimes, Weakness is Strength</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this game, you won\u2019t always win by making the strongest-looking spell.<br>There are moments when crafting a deliberately weak spell is part of the strategy.<br>Your tactical flexibility will be tested.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25a0Chuunibyou-Style Spell Descriptions, Too...?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yes, the AI might even describe your spell in dramatic, over-the-top style\u2014straight out of a teenage fantasy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25a0 Notes</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game uses the conversational AI &quot;ChatGPT&quot; provided by OpenAI. Depending on server load, the game may take extra time to process spell evaluations.<br><br>If OpenAI makes any changes to the ChatGPT service, this game may be suspended or discontinued without prior notice. We appreciate your understanding.</p>","developers":["MONO ENTERTAINMENT"],"genres":[{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622760/17577f0d292ed3838d9ac8caa7923821de0136f7/header.jpg?t=1755848977","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</stro